#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_maximum)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIntSpinBox, c_maximum)
#: kplayersettingsaudio.ui:135 kplayersettingsaudio.ui:169
